     "text": {
      "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
      "text": "<p><b>iEi Embedded Systems</b> are rugged, modular platforms designed for demanding industrial and commercial environments. These systems combine reliable hardware design with rich I/O options, scalable expansion, and flexible mounting, making them ideal for automation, transportation, surveillance, kiosks, and digital signage.</p>\r\n",
